==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|zombifies|zombifying|zombified}}

# {{context|transitive|fictional|lang=en}} To turn into a [[zombie]] (a member of the [[living dead]] or [[undead]]).
#* '''1994''', Arnold et al., ''A History of Literature in the Caribbean: Hispanic and Francophone Regions'':
#*: She managed to flee the sorcerer who had attempted to '''zombify''' her and enjoyed relative prosperity in Jamaica.
# {{context|transitive|computing|of a personal computer|lang=en}} To use as a [[zombie]] in order to disseminate [[spam]].
#: ''These trojans can '''zombify''' your machine.''

